              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Aspasia Jones"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tried it this year for the first time; I try a different recipe \"rotate\" every year, to go along with our \"regular\"fare over the Thanksgiving / Christmas holidays. I do believe this will become one of the \"regulars\"! It was definitely a hit! Thank you for sharing!"
          },
