            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Deb C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is one of those interesting recipes that you’re not quite sure how to rate it. I thought the flavor was good, but I didn’t care for the texture. My husband, who never eats sweet potato, ate it. Who knew? I added the coconut and chopped pecans. For me, I’ll stick with the cooked mashed sweet potato in casseroles; however I’m glad I tried this. It was interesting.",
